      interpolation, exits non-zero and names the offending index(es)
      in stderr, routing the user to `/aide:brain config`. `.mcp.json`
      is not touched on this path." Keep the existing exit-code
      contract block but extend the exit-1 enumeration to include
      null-bearing args.

- [ ] 2d. Grep the file (and only this file) one more time for the
      string `obsidian` to confirm zero remaining references. The
      module-level JSDoc, the entries map, the report block, and any
